      "name": "acquire_upload_guard",
      "summary": "获取上传守卫：等待无清理进行后登记当前线程的上传计数，返回 RAII 的 UploadGuard 对象。",
      "tags": ["upload", "guard", "synchronization"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "lineRange": [105, 115]
    },
    {
      "id": "function:db/include/chunk_lifecycle_coordinator.h:acquire_cleanup_guard",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "acquire_cleanup_guard",
      "summary": "获取清理守卫：等待所有上传结束且无清理进行，标记清理活动状态与归属线程，异常时回退等待计数并唤醒。",
      "tags": ["cleanup", "guard", "synchronization"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "lineRange": [117, 139]
    },
